      "writtenOn": "2021-08-15T06:01:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I\u0027ve found a small hiccup in pushing these changes: there are a ton of boards overriding svdm_dp_config() that I hadn\u0027t noticed before the HPD API update.  So having the DPM set safe mode will be different behavior than these boards had before... I may need to think about this again when I get back.  And/or ping the owners of those boards to figure out if safe state was an oversight or something they intentionally avoid",
      "parentUuid": "da6ad61f_171644c9",
      "revId": "85510b0fe07594091975f77b62af378d6323ee2f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a5fdb4b7_c20a1124",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_alt_mode_dfp.c",
