      "writtenOn": "2021-08-16T16:26:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIRC, the spec\u0027s AMS diagrams only show one stage of Exit Mode, and they show the mux being set to safe mode. Therefore, a strict reading of the spec would suggest setting safe mode during the Exit Mode AMS for each of SOP, SOP\u0027, and SOP\u0027\u0027. It\u0027s a similar situation for Enter Mode, and I think this code originally had that too. I think we later took it out because it seemed pointless, possibly prompted by some weird interaction with the TCSS or by Intel\u0027s flowchart.",
      "parentUuid": "eea8158f_d853943b",
      "revId": "85510b0fe07594091975f77b62af378d6323ee2f",
